\newlabel{fig:rag-prompt}{{1.8}{15}{The prompt the model receives in Harbor's RAG component. The two passages were found by semantic search. The model's job is reduced to reading them and answering with a citation: \emph {No. Discounts above 15\% need the regional sales manager's written approval [Discount Policy, \S 4.2, v2026-Q3].}}{figure.1.8}{}}
